# CODEOWNERS: <https://help.github.com/articles/about-codeowners/>

# The review policy (.github/review-policy.md) auto-approves [low] and [medium]
# PRs from trusted authors. Because the tag is chosen by the author, the files
# that define the policy and agent behavior always need a protocol team
# approval. "Require review from Code Owners" must stay enabled on main for
# this to be enforced.

# The review policy, the workflow that applies it, and Dependabot's tier
# prefixes, including this file. Other CI and repo automation under .github/
# has no code owner, so an auto-approval covers it.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @celestiaorg/protocol
/.github/review-policy.md @celestiaorg/protocol
/.github/workflows/auto-approve.yml @celestiaorg/protocol
/.github/dependabot.yml @celestiaorg/protocol

# Build and lint config.
/.golangci.yml @celestiaorg/protocol
/Makefile @celestiaorg/protocol
/celestia-node.mk @celestiaorg/protocol

# Agent and reviewer instructions.
/.agents/ @celestiaorg/protocol
/.claude/ @celestiaorg/protocol
/.cursor/ @celestiaorg/protocol
AGENTS.md @celestiaorg/protocol
CLAUDE.md @celestiaorg/protocol
GEMINI.md @celestiaorg/protocol

# The Contributing section defines the [low], [medium], and [high] tiers.
/CONTRIBUTING.md @celestiaorg/protocol
